  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "U921FZYAwlotWgcX8QNoeQYzdWU=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:32:01.799Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Perficient's entry in the Flowable Partner Finder describes a global digital consultancy based in St. Louis, and the flag pairs two grounds for exclusion: non-EU and enterprise. Nothing engine-specific was found against it.\n\nThe row illustrates how the sweep triaged. Where geography and scale both apply, the research stopped at the card rather than resolving verticals, allegiance or delivery depth \u2014 the entry was mined on 2026-08-18 and never imprint-swept. That keeps the cost of screening a 200-plus-entry directory proportionate, at the price of a record that supports no judgement beyond the exclusion itself.\n\nKept as a registry entry, its value is negative evidence: it documents that a firm of this profile was seen and set aside deliberately, so it does not resurface as an unexplored lead.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- Perficient (US St. Louis MO) \u2014 perficient.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Global digital consultancy. Non-EU enterprise \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:32:01.799548Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:32:01.799552Z"
    }
  },
